[{"title":"游晋祠和壁上韵","author":"祁顺","text":"佳景传闻未易寻，远来登览惬初心。\n群山钟秀此为异，一水有灵安在深。\n唐叔祠宫新胜旧，晋阳疆土古犹今。\n碑题满眼耽看久，老树庭前转午阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50845,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸丑除夕次敖静之韵","author":"祁顺","text":"雪飘残腊玉铺尘，暖入条风节报春。\n六十年来垂老境，九千里外未归人。\n宦程自笑先居后，岁月从教故又新。\n朋旧别离相忆切，愁肠终日转车轮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50846,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋之夕陈方伯廉夫招饮","author":"祁顺","text":"画堂红烛照深更，对景相看感至情。\n秋色正当今夕半，月轮应似故乡明。\n一樽酩酊忘宾主，四海交游即弟兄。\n却恐宦途容易别，思君何处可寻盟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50847,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"生朝自述","author":"祁顺","text":"寓世初经两甲寅，重阳前日是生辰。\n衰颜半似黄花瘦，老眼全惊白发新。\n两字功名真笑我，一生才行不如人。\n将来岁月知多少，正好投闲乐此身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50848,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和晋府世殿下韵","author":"祁顺","text":"蓬岛风光信异常，四时花木总春阳。\n连云山色千层秀，绕郭河流一派长。\n尧殿蓂开新日月，周家桐剪旧封疆。\n金枝玉叶相传远，世笃忠贞答圣皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50849,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张大参文璧还真定","author":"祁顺","text":"名邦太守古诸侯，籍甚声华迈等流。\n超擢喜膺明主命，去思还为小民留。\n恒山苍翠凝归思，晋水汪洋带别愁。\n明日相思人两地，不堪惆怅倚高楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50850,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又代陈方伯作","author":"祁顺","text":"昔年同作水曹郎，尊酒重逢在晋阳。\n治郡久闻驰政誉，参藩新喜拜恩光。\n两岐瑞应张堪麦，千里阴连召伯棠。\n父老攀留知不久，汉廷卿相属循良。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50851,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次敖静之赠行韵","author":"祁顺","text":"胸吞云梦气横秋，三峡词源日倒流。\n正喜同官薰晋鄙，可堪临别赠吴钩。\n翰林风月长庚老，杜曲烟花子美愁。\n欲问相思意何限，汴河汾水两悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50852,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次陈粹之见赠韵","author":"祁顺","text":"路入姑苏指八闽，相逢都觉雪盈簪。\n一生踪迹浑如梦，廿载交游已见心。\n驽马厌驰官道远，老龙闲卧海波深。\n多情赠我诗三百，一度相思一度吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50853,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丙辰三月升江西左布政使","author":"祁顺","text":"春风恩命出金銮，忝拜薇垣第一官。\n滕阁衣冠登览旧，闽邦黎庶别离难。\n千滩雪浪随舟远，一路云山当画看。\n愿效忠勤报明主，鬓毛虽白寸心丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50854,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大横舟中","author":"祁顺","text":"一叶扁舟自在行，闽山闽水照人清。\n閒园见竹谁为主，野路看花不记名。\n风雨惯回乡国梦，壶觞难尽故交情。\n衰残缪总旬宣寄，北望金门感愧并。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50855,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送司马宪副伯通致仕","author":"祁顺","text":"京国交游直到今，老来分手欲沾襟。\n百年豪杰符公论，千古峨洋有赏音。\n山色直随归旆远，海波难比别情深。\n重论尊酒知何日，云树苍茫两地心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50856,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送金佥宪进表分得冀北朝天","author":"祁顺","text":"豸史声华动百僚，鹭车才到又趍朝。\n闽南山色催行早，冀北风光入望遥。\n万岁声中瞻黼扆，五云深处听箫韶。\n悬知竣事归来日，带得甘霖下九霄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50857,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏燕","author":"祁顺","text":"毛羽照青春，衔泥不厌频。\n画梁高处好，谁是捲帘人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50858,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扇面梅花二首 其一","author":"祁顺","text":"一段孤山景，移来掌握中。\n平生冰玉操，不与百花同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50859,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扇面梅花二首 其二","author":"祁顺","text":"细剪银河水，并刀不露痕。\n南枝春意早，别是一乾坤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50860,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉使香河","author":"祁顺","text":"奉使恩非薄，香河路不遥。\n如何离别后，情绪便萧条。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50861,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"香河舟中","author":"祁顺","text":"溪上孤舟月，诗怀分外多。\n几年尘土梦，今夜总消磨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50862,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花阁","author":"祁顺","text":"阁因梅僻静，梅为阁精神。\n影落罗浮月，香分庾岭春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50863,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓟城东石桥","author":"祁顺","text":"白鹤归华表，苍苔没古碑。\n桥前呜咽水，犹恨禄山儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50864,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"螺山寺","author":"祁顺","text":"古寺螺山上，登临恨未能。\n临风闲驻马，看破白云层。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50865,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"连山关","author":"祁顺","text":"云连关上山，草暗山前路。\n扰扰防边人，何时罢征戍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50866,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过播州","author":"祁顺","text":"宗元敦友义，愿以柳易播。\n古来势利交，徒为青史涴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50867,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出介休","author":"祁顺","text":"云汉星初落，扶桑日未红。\n介山青满眼，相迓出城东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50868,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见新月","author":"祁顺","text":"天宇净无云，一钩初月新。\n清光偏有意，先照远游人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50869,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题董少参砥柱图","author":"祁顺","text":"世道日悠悠，颓波不可收。\n何人挺孤柱，千古矻中流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50870,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东岩四咏同次前中书丁玉夫韵 其一 南亩春耕","author":"祁顺","text":"一犁烟雨昏，四野春云湿。\n村前布谷声，牛背寒鸦立。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50871,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东岩四咏同次前中书丁玉夫韵 其二 蓝江晚渡","author":"祁顺","text":"断厓暗芳草，滑石多莓苔。\n夕阳争渡客，何不早归来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50872,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东岩四咏同次前中书丁玉夫韵 其三 古石堆云","author":"祁顺","text":"浮云本无根，触石成遛逗。\n题诗扫石镌，无用拂红袖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50873,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东岩四咏同次前中书丁玉夫韵 其四 北潭钓雪","author":"祁顺","text":"潭水静如练，野云低不飞。\n钓船风雪满，薄暮得鱼归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50874,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过长沙怀贾傅 其一","author":"祁顺","text":"汉文方有道，痛哭岂狂迷。\n世事宜先虑，无令后噬脐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50875,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过长沙怀贾傅 其二","author":"祁顺","text":"贤才遭废斥，天意竟如何。\n万里长沙外，迩来人更多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50876,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滩上","author":"祁顺","text":"失缆危滩上，停桡浅水滨。\n纷纷向前者，都是后来人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50877,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湘口","author":"祁顺","text":"湘口逢重五，凄然吊汨罗。\n忠魂无处问，风雨撼江波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50878,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过全州怀先舅樵山卢先生先生宣德间司教是郡师道有立至今郡人思之 其一","author":"祁顺","text":"全郡人才盛，先生实有功。\n十年遗化雨，千里变儒风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50879,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过全州怀先舅樵山卢先生先生宣德间司教是郡师道有立至今郡人思之 其二","author":"祁顺","text":"逢人询往事，四纪未能忘。\n一掬伤心泪，无由到渭阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50880,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"周冬官子建如京师至山海值雨同咏","author":"祁顺","text":"北风吹雪满关城，寒气侵人夜不胜。\n无限客愁消未得，坐挥吟笔对孤灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50881,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆亡弟宏","author":"祁顺","text":"梦里分明一见君，恩情犹在死生分。\n惠连春草池塘句，无限伤心不忍闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50882,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彦卿得子以诗来示依韵酬之","author":"祁顺","text":"华缄千里寄欢声，亲爱深关父子情。\n愿得明年重有报，便题诗句赠徐卿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50883,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭从兄伟","author":"祁顺","text":"昔年书剑上长安，万里江山共往还。\n我幸成名君已殁，报恩空有泪痕斑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50884,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送举人何净南还 其一","author":"祁顺","text":"长才应拟早登科，迟速由天可奈何。\n莫向归途重惆怅，人间秋后月明多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50885,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送举人何净南还 其二","author":"祁顺","text":"白云飞度太行山，游子思亲万里还。\n到手功名谁不羡，绿袍争似彩衣斑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50886,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风梅","author":"祁顺","text":"飞雪无声点画阑，树头春意已含酸。\n天公为促调羹早，故遣狂风昨夜寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50887,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"烟梅","author":"祁顺","text":"姑射山前旧往还，群仙绰约玉为颜。\n如今相见浑相识，只隔香云缥渺间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50888,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪梅","author":"祁顺","text":"满树琼瑶眩太空，六花淩乱散香风。\n灞桥诗思知何限，并入西湖百咏中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50889,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月梅","author":"祁顺","text":"篱边疏影弄新晴，月与寒花一样清。\n记得罗浮耽玩久，数枝临水更分明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50890,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚寅岁八月见白髭","author":"祁顺","text":"少不如人老可惊，百千功业几能成。\n含愁谩掩窗前镜，新见吟髭白一茎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50891,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答友人","author":"祁顺","text":"仕路驱驰十载馀，一官名秩尚如初。\n铨曹留得唐资格，不但开元有圣书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50892,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己丑岁二月二十五日往天寿山陪祀三首 其一","author":"祁顺","text":"两载淹淹不出城，谒陵今日喜郊行。\n红尘车马繁华地，得似云山意味清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f8